{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he poured a drink-offering upon it.</b> He thus fulfilled the vow he had made when he said: וְהָאֶבֶן הַזֹּאת אֲשֶׁר שַׂמְתִּי מַצֵּבָה יִהְיֶה בֵּית אֱלֹהִים (Genesis 28:22). For by this he prepared the place suitable for establishing there a House of Elohim, as with David when the angel appeared to him at the threshing-floor of Araunah the Jebusite."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:24.138617900Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}